{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23609","headline":"晚起 · 白居易","name":"晚起","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"卧听冬冬衙鼓声，起迟睡足长心情。\n华簪脱後头虽白，堆案抛来眼校明。\n闲上篮轝乘兴出，醉回花舫信风行。\n明朝更濯尘缨去，闻道松江水最清。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23609.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23609","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}